  "prepublication_findings": [
    "Initial disk exhaustion was resolved without deleting user data. After the final committed build and gates, an isolated preflight browser profile was excluded from the assembly. Exact runtime resources were compared with committed source and the standard inventory, archive validation, fresh extraction and complete smoke stages resumed successfully.",
    "Packaged File Manager acceptance exposed stale Part/Assembly versions in the lightweight metadata reader. The final source fixes both and registers independent parameter-inspection coverage.",
    "Signing completed but its temporary second extraction exhausted disk space. The unchanged signed archive and attestations were verified, freshly extracted and passed the complete official runtime smoke in a separate directory. Public verification reused that fresh extraction after matching every immutable file to the identical anonymously downloaded archive."
  ]
